#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5-apps/okular5.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Okular is a document viewer for KDE. It can view documents of many types "
"including PDF, PostScript, TIFF, Microsoft CHM, DjVu, DVI, XPS and ePub."
msgstr ""
"&quot;Okular&quot; é um visualizador de documentos para o &quot;KDE&quot;. "
"Ele consegue visualizar documentos de muitos tipos, incluindo "
"&quot;PDF&quot;, &quot;PostScript&quot;, &quot;TIFF&quot;, &quot;CHM&quot; "
"da Microsoft, &quot;DjVu&quot;, &quot;DVI&quot;, &quot;XPS&quot; e "
"&quot;ePub&quot;."

